## Symptom

B244 rate_limited/retry_after_s are written to connector-state.json (c2c_relay_connector.ml:1336-1341) but the typed reader (1387-1462) has no such fields, and every consumer (c2c_doctor_relay.ml:1004, c2c_relay_state.ml:239, c2c_send_cmd.ml:107, c2c_monitor_cmd.ml:763) uses the typed reader - Relay_state.connector_info exposes no rate-limit field either. The comment promising doctor/whoami surfacing of chronic 429s is unrealized; the only 429 visibility is connector stdout.

## Fix direction

Add cs_rate_limited/cs_retry_after_s to the typed record; render them in Relay_state.connector_json/connector_human.

